7: ERROR: `>` after `a*-_` is neither a field nor a selection operator — there is no `*-_>` operator: a glued `*-_>` reads as `*-_` then `>`, and the `>` would become a branch of its own. Drop the `>`: `a*-_` ends its branch, and each field after it is a branch of its own
